  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Private Sector Energy Development Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Desarrollo Sector Energtico Privado</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FINANCING WILL BE PROVIDED FOR: (I) A CONTRIBUTION TO A GOVERNMENT FUND FOR LOANS TO PRIVATE SECTOR DEVELOPERS THAT ARE PARTICIPATING IN TWO ENERGY PROJECTS (LOW SPEED DIESEL AND GAS TURBINES); (II) TRANSMISSION FACILITIES; (III) TECHNICAL ASSISTANCE TO JPS AND THE FUND. THE WORLD BANK WILL CONTRIBUTE THE SAME AMOUNT AS THE IDB TO &quot;I&quot; AND FINANCE ANOTHER GAS TURBINE FOR JPS CO.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
